{"ancestors": "0,9014198,9018833", "bizKey": "9018835", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-09-18 10:50:49", "detail": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>题材基本面介绍：</strong></span></p><p><strong>1.应用部位</strong></p><p>汽车轴承的应用部位主要是发动机、传动系统、转向系统、辅助部件等。汽车发动机轴承分为内部轴承和发动机部件轴承两部分：发动机内部有曲轴和凸轮轴支承的滑动轴承，以及气门摇臂滚针轴承和正时链轮滚动轴承。转向系统轴承包括转向柱管支承轴承、EPS 电机及减速机用小型球轴承、循环球式助力系统用四点接触球轴承等。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/25/0d91083b-ae2b-452c-8af2-8440bc9eed0a-1687695246204.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 566.00px;height: 280.44px;\"/></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/25/f9c13b2f-ac9d-49d1-885b-dc5db8bfa115-1687695294981.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 594.00px;height: 306.34px;\"/></p><p><br></p><p><strong>2.产业链情况</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/25/a3686079-4ef5-434b-9f0c-61eec1476e5e-1687696553536.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 621.00px;height: 304.44px;\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "ZC", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "轴承", "parentId": 9018833, "pctChg": 0.69, "reason": "汽车轴承相关企业", "remark": "", "sort": -10, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9018835, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-09-18 10:50:49"}
